            <title><![CDATA[Welcome to AEM Multi-Brand Documentation]]></title>
            <link>https://acs-ui.github.io/eds-multi-brand-docs/blog/welcome</link>
            <guid>https://acs-ui.github.io/eds-multi-brand-docs/blog/welcome</guid>
            <pubDate>Thu, 26 Aug 2021 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
            <description><![CDATA[Welcome to the AEM Multi-Brand project documentation! This site provides comprehensive developer documentation for building and managing multi-brand experiences with Adobe Experience Manager.]]></description>
            <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Welcome to the AEM Multi-Brand project documentation! This site provides comprehensive developer documentation for building and managing multi-brand experiences with Adobe Experience Manager.</p>
<h2 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="what-youll-find-here">What You'll Find Here<a href="https://acs-ui.github.io/eds-multi-brand-docs/blog/welcome#what-youll-find-here" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to What You'll Find Here" title="Direct link to What You'll Find Here">​</a></h2>
<p>This documentation covers:</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Getting Started</strong>: Quick setup and installation guides</li>
<li><strong>Theme Management</strong>: How to create and manage brand themes</li>
<li><strong>Blocks</strong>: Reusable UI components for your projects</li>
<li><strong>Deployment</strong>: How to deploy your multi-brand applications</li>
</ul>
<h2 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="project-structure">Project Structure<a href="https://acs-ui.github.io/eds-multi-brand-docs/blog/welcome#project-structure" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Project Structure" title="Direct link to Project Structure">​</a></h2>
<p>The AEM Multi-Brand project is organized to support multiple brands with shared components and brand-specific customizations. Each brand can have its own theme while sharing common functionality.</p>
<h2 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="getting-started">Getting Started<a href="https://acs-ui.github.io/eds-multi-brand-docs/blog/welcome#getting-started" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Getting Started" title="Direct link to Getting Started">​</a></h2>
<p>To get started with the AEM Multi-Brand project:</p>
<ol>
<li><strong>Install dependencies</strong>: <code>npm install</code></li>
<li><strong>Initialize a new theme</strong>: <code>npm run scaffold:create</code></li>
<li><strong>Start development</strong>: <code>npm start</code></li>
</ol>
<h2 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="contributing">Contributing<a href="https://acs-ui.github.io/eds-multi-brand-docs/blog/welcome#contributing" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Contributing" title="Direct link to Contributing">​</a></h2>
<p>We welcome contributions! Please create an issue or submit a pull request on GitHub for any improvements or bug reports.</p>
<h2 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="support">Support<a href="https://acs-ui.github.io/eds-multi-brand-docs/blog/welcome#support" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Support" title="Direct link to Support">​</a></h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Documentation Issues</strong>: Create an issue in this repository</li>
<li><strong>AEM Questions</strong>: Check <a href="https://stackoverflow.com/questions/tagged/aem" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Stack Overflow</a></li>
<li><strong>Community</strong>: Join our <a href="https://discordapp.com/invite/aem" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Discord</a> community</li>
</ul>
<p>Happy coding! 🚀</p>]]></content:encoded>
            <category>AEM</category>
            <category>Multi-Brand</category>
            <category>Documentation</category>
            <category>Welcome</category>
        </item>
        <item>
            <title><![CDATA[Interactive Documentation with MDX]]></title>
            <link>https://acs-ui.github.io/eds-multi-brand-docs/blog/mdx-blog-post</link>
            <guid>https://acs-ui.github.io/eds-multi-brand-docs/blog/mdx-blog-post</guid>
            <pubDate>Sun, 01 Aug 2021 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
            <description><![CDATA[This blog post demonstrates how to use MDX (Markdown + JSX) to create interactive documentation for the EDS Multi-Brand project.]]></description>
            <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>This blog post demonstrates how to use MDX (Markdown + JSX) to create interactive documentation for the EDS Multi-Brand project.</p>
<p>Blog posts support <a href="https://docusaurus.io/docs/markdown-features" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Docusaurus Markdown features</a>, such as <a href="https://mdxjs.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">MDX</a>.</p>
<div class="theme-admonition theme-admonition-tip admonition_xJq3 alert alert--success"><div class="admonitionHeading_Gvgb"><span class="admonitionIcon_Rf37"><svg viewBox="0 0 12 16"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M6.5 0C3.48 0 1 2.19 1 5c0 .92.55 2.25 1 3 1.34 2.25 1.78 2.78 2 4v1h5v-1c.22-1.22.66-1.75 2-4 .45-.75 1-2.08 1-3 0-2.81-2.48-5-5.5-5zm3.64 7.48c-.25.44-.47.8-.67 1.11-.86 1.41-1.25 2.06-1.45 3.23-.02.05-.02.11-.02.17H5c0-.06 0-.13-.02-.17-.2-1.17-.59-1.83-1.45-3.23-.2-.31-.42-.67-.67-1.11C2.44 6.78 2 5.65 2 5c0-2.2 2.02-4 4.5-4 1.22 0 2.36.42 3.22 1.19C10.55 2.94 11 3.94 11 5c0 .66-.44 1.78-.86 2.48zM4 14h5c-.23 1.14-1.3 2-2.5 2s-2.27-.86-2.5-2z"></path></svg></span>tip</div><div class="admonitionContent_BuS1"><p>Use the power of React to create interactive documentation components.</p></div></div>
<!-- -->
<h2 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="interactive-components">Interactive Components<a href="https://acs-ui.github.io/eds-multi-brand-docs/blog/mdx-blog-post#interactive-components" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Interactive Components" title="Direct link to Interactive Components">​</a></h2>
<p>You can use JSX to create interactive components in your documentation. For example, here's an interactive theme preview:</p>
<div class="language-jsx codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#393A34;--prism-background-color:#f6f8fa"><div class="codeBlockContent_QJqH"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-jsx codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#393A34;background-color:#f6f8fa"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token tag punctuation" style="color:#393A34">&lt;</span><span class="token tag" style="color:#00009f">button</span><span class="token tag" style="color:#00009f"> </span><span class="token tag attr-name" style="color:#00a4db">onClick</span><span class="token tag script language-javascript script-punctuation punctuation" style="color:#393A34">=</span><span class="token tag script language-javascript punctuation" style="color:#393A34">{</span><span class="token tag script language-javascript punctuation" style="color:#393A34">(</span><span class="token tag script language-javascript punctuation" style="color:#393A34">)</span><span class="token tag script language-javascript" style="color:#00009f"> </span><span class="token tag script language-javascript arrow operator" style="color:#393A34">=&gt;</span><span class="token tag script language-javascript" style="color:#00009f"> </span><span class="token tag script language-javascript function" style="color:#d73a49">alert</span><span class="token tag script language-javascript punctuation" style="color:#393A34">(</span><span class="token tag script language-javascript string" style="color:#e3116c">'Theme preview clicked!'</span><span class="token tag script language-javascript punctuation" style="color:#393A34">)</span><span class="token tag script language-javascript punctuation" style="color:#393A34">}</span><span class="token tag punctuation" style="color:#393A34">&gt;</span><span class="token plain-text">Preview Theme</span><span class="token tag punctuation" style="color:#393A34">&lt;/</span><span class="token tag" style="color:#00009f">button</span><span class="token tag punctuation" style="color:#393A34">&gt;</span><br></span></code></pre></div></div>
<button>Preview Theme</button>
<h2 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="benefits-of-mdx">Benefits of MDX<a href="https://acs-ui.github.io/eds-multi-brand-docs/blog/mdx-blog-post#benefits-of-mdx" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Benefits of MDX" title="Direct link to Benefits of MDX">​</a></h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Interactive examples</strong>: Embed working components in documentation</li>
<li><strong>Dynamic content</strong>: Create responsive documentation</li>
<li><strong>Better engagement</strong>: Keep readers engaged with interactive elements</li>
<li><strong>Code examples</strong>: Show live code examples with working demos</li>
</ul>
<h2 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="use-cases-for-eds-multi-brand">Use Cases for EDS Multi-Brand<a href="https://acs-ui.github.io/eds-multi-brand-docs/blog/mdx-blog-post#use-cases-for-eds-multi-brand" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Use Cases for EDS Multi-Brand" title="Direct link to Use Cases for EDS Multi-Brand">​</a></h2>
<ul>
<li>Theme configuration wizards</li>
<li>Component preview tools</li>
<li>Brand switching demos</li>
<li>Interactive tutorials</li>
</ul>
<p>This makes our documentation more engaging and helps developers understand concepts faster!</p>]]></content:encoded>
