        <item>
            <title><![CDATA[Deep Dive: Multi-Brand Architecture]]></title>
            <link>https://acs-ui.github.io/eds-multi-brand-docs/blog/long-blog-post</link>
            <guid>https://acs-ui.github.io/eds-multi-brand-docs/blog/long-blog-post</guid>
            <pubDate>Wed, 29 May 2019 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
            <description><![CDATA[This is a comprehensive guide to the EDS Multi-Brand architecture and implementation details.]]></description>
            <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>This is a comprehensive guide to the EDS Multi-Brand architecture and implementation details.</p>
<p>Use a <code>&lt;!--</code> <code>truncate</code> <code>--&gt;</code> comment to limit blog post size in the list view.</p>
<h2 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="architecture-overview">Architecture Overview<a href="https://acs-ui.github.io/eds-multi-brand-docs/blog/long-blog-post#architecture-overview" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Architecture Overview" title="Direct link to Architecture Overview">​</a></h2>
<p>The EDS Multi-Brand project is built on a foundation of shared components and brand-specific theming. This architecture allows for maximum code reuse while maintaining brand differentiation.</p>
<h2 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="core-principles">Core Principles<a href="https://acs-ui.github.io/eds-multi-brand-docs/blog/long-blog-post#core-principles" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Core Principles" title="Direct link to Core Principles">​</a></h2>
<h3 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="1-shared-component-library">1. Shared Component Library<a href="https://acs-ui.github.io/eds-multi-brand-docs/blog/long-blog-post#1-shared-component-library" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to 1. Shared Component Library" title="Direct link to 1. Shared Component Library">​</a></h3>
<p>All brands share a common component library that provides consistent functionality across different brand experiences. This includes:</p>
<ul>
<li>Navigation components</li>
<li>Content blocks</li>
<li>Interactive elements</li>
<li>Form components</li>
</ul>
<h3 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="2-brand-specific-theming">2. Brand-Specific Theming<a href="https://acs-ui.github.io/eds-multi-brand-docs/blog/long-blog-post#2-brand-specific-theming" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to 2. Brand-Specific Theming" title="Direct link to 2. Brand-Specific Theming">​</a></h3>
<p>Each brand can have its own theme that customizes the appearance of shared components. Themes include:</p>
<ul>
<li>Color palettes</li>
<li>Typography</li>
<li>Spacing and layout</li>
<li>Brand-specific assets</li>
</ul>
<h3 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="3-configuration-driven-development">3. Configuration-Driven Development<a href="https://acs-ui.github.io/eds-multi-brand-docs/blog/long-blog-post#3-configuration-driven-development" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to 3. Configuration-Driven Development" title="Direct link to 3. Configuration-Driven Development">​</a></h3>
<p>The project uses configuration files to define brand-specific settings, making it easy to add new brands without code changes.</p>
<h2 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="implementation-details">Implementation Details<a href="https://acs-ui.github.io/eds-multi-brand-docs/blog/long-blog-post#implementation-details" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Implementation Details" title="Direct link to Implementation Details">​</a></h2>
<h3 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="theme-system">Theme System<a href="https://acs-ui.github.io/eds-multi-brand-docs/blog/long-blog-post#theme-system" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Theme System" title="Direct link to Theme System">​</a></h3>
<p>The theme system uses CSS custom properties to define brand variables:</p>
<div class="language-css codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#393A34;--prism-background-color:#f6f8fa"><div class="codeBlockContent_QJqH"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-css codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#393A34;background-color:#f6f8fa"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token selector pseudo-class" style="color:#00009f">:root</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">{</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">  </span><span class="token variable" style="color:#36acaa">--brand-primary</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">:</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token hexcode color">#007bff</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">;</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">  </span><span class="token variable" style="color:#36acaa">--brand-secondary</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">:</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token hexcode color">#6c757d</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">;</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">  </span><span class="token variable" style="color:#36acaa">--brand-accent</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">:</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token hexcode color">#28a745</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">;</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain"></span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">}</span><br></span></code></pre></div></div>
<h3 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="component-structure">Component Structure<a href="https://acs-ui.github.io/eds-multi-brand-docs/blog/long-blog-post#component-structure" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Component Structure" title="Direct link to Component Structure">​</a></h3>
<p>Each component follows a consistent structure:</p>
<div class="language-text codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#393A34;--prism-background-color:#f6f8fa"><div class="codeBlockContent_QJqH"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-text codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#393A34;background-color:#f6f8fa"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">blocks/</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">├── component-name/</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">│   ├── component-name.css</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">│   ├── component-name.js</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">│   └── block-config.js</span><br></span></code></pre></div></div>
<h3 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="brand-configuration">Brand Configuration<a href="https://acs-ui.github.io/eds-multi-brand-docs/blog/long-blog-post#brand-configuration" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Brand Configuration" title="Direct link to Brand Configuration">​</a></h3>
<p>Brands are configured through environment variables and configuration files:</p>
<div class="language-javascript codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#393A34;--prism-background-color:#f6f8fa"><div class="codeBlockContent_QJqH"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-javascript codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#393A34;background-color:#f6f8fa"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token comment" style="color:#999988;font-style:italic">// Brand configuration</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain"></span><span class="token keyword" style="color:#00009f">const</span><span class="token plain"> brands </span><span class="token operator" style="color:#393A34">=</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">{</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">  </span><span class="token literal-property property" style="color:#36acaa">brand1</span><span class="token operator" style="color:#393A34">:</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">{</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">    </span><span class="token literal-property property" style="color:#36acaa">name</span><span class="token operator" style="color:#393A34">:</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token string" style="color:#e3116c">'Brand One'</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">,</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">    </span><span class="token literal-property property" style="color:#36acaa">theme</span><span class="token operator" style="color:#393A34">:</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token string" style="color:#e3116c">'brand1-theme'</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">,</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">    </span><span class="token literal-property property" style="color:#36acaa">assets</span><span class="token operator" style="color:#393A34">:</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token string" style="color:#e3116c">'/brand1/assets'</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">  </span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">}</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain"></span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">}</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">;</span><br></span></code></pre></div></div>
<h2 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="best-practices">Best Practices<a href="https://acs-ui.github.io/eds-multi-brand-docs/blog/long-blog-post#best-practices" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Best Practices" title="Direct link to Best Practices">​</a></h2>
<ol>
<li><strong>Always use shared components</strong> when possible</li>
<li><strong>Keep brand-specific code minimal</strong></li>
<li><strong>Test across all brands</strong> during development</li>
<li><strong>Document brand requirements</strong> clearly</li>
<li><strong>Use semantic HTML</strong> for accessibility</li>
</ol>
<h2 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="performance-considerations">Performance Considerations<a href="https://acs-ui.github.io/eds-multi-brand-docs/blog/long-blog-post#performance-considerations" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Performance Considerations" title="Direct link to Performance Considerations">​</a></h2>
<ul>
<li>Shared components are cached across brands</li>
<li>Brand-specific assets are loaded on demand</li>
<li>CSS is optimized for each brand</li>
<li>JavaScript is bundled efficiently</li>
</ul>
<h2 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="future-enhancements">Future Enhancements<a href="https://acs-ui.github.io/eds-multi-brand-docs/blog/long-blog-post#future-enhancements" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Future Enhancements" title="Direct link to Future Enhancements">​</a></h2>
<p>We're planning several enhancements to the multi-brand system:</p>
<ul>
<li>Advanced theming capabilities</li>
<li>Brand-specific component variants</li>
<li>Automated brand testing</li>
<li>Enhanced performance optimizations</li>
</ul>
<p>Stay tuned for more technical deep dives and implementation guides!</p>]]></content:encoded>
